From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheKit <thekit@disroot.org>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 14:37:32 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] WayDroidService: Resync active_apps from the task stack

Only host-side launches wrote waydroid.active_apps, so any
Android-side navigation (in-app intents, notifications, task
switches) left it stale and cards/input then targeted the wrong app.

Register a TaskStackListener and publish the focused task's package.
The host-owned closed/full-ui values and the hidden launcher are left
alone.

Change-Id: I2b6834d10c1dbe78ba86068ca42dff5fde036df5
---
 .../platform/internal/WayDroidService.java    | 54 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 54 insertions(+)

diff --git a/lineage/lib/main/java/org/lineageos/platform/internal/WayDroidService.java b/lineage/lib/main/java/org/lineageos/platform/internal/WayDroidService.java
index a42b7cc..47acc11 100644
--- a/lineage/lib/main/java/org/lineageos/platform/internal/WayDroidService.java
+++ b/lineage/lib/main/java/org/lineageos/platform/internal/WayDroidService.java
@@ -16,10 +16,12 @@
 
 package org.lineageos.platform.internal;
 
